WEBVTT

00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:06.239
This video shows how to add a book, a chapter and a topic to the curriculum on a phone.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:15.748
Tap the menu button, open Content Creation and choose Curriculum. The page lists the books of your classes.

00:00:17.551 --> 00:00:23.143
Choose the class, then the subject. The books for them are listed below.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:32.830
Tap Add Book. Choose the class and the subject, then type the title and the edition.

00:00:48.171 --> 00:00:54.627
Tap Add Book again. A message says the book is created, and it appears in the list.

00:00:58.219 --> 00:01:04.747
Tap the book. Its details open below the list, with a button to add chapters.

00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:13.649
Tap Add Chapter, type the chapter title and tap Add Chapter again. A message confirms the new chapter.

00:01:20.171 --> 00:01:30.587
Tap the chapter to open it, then tap Add Topic. Type the topic title and tap Add Topic again. The topic appears under the chapter.

00:01:37.248 --> 00:01:48.648
To add a whole book at once, tap Import Table of Contents. On the Manual Entry tab you type or paste the chapters and topics, or you can use the Upload Photo tab.

00:01:57.395 --> 00:02:02.339
The book now has a chapter and a topic, and lesson plans can use them.
